object\";s:7:\"subtype\";s:6:\"object\";}'),(47,'content:6.author','input','Hans-Peter Wurst, Classic Cars Dealer Testimonial, Munich, Germany'),(47,'content:6.position','select','left'),(47,'content:6.quote','input','Exceptional service! The support team took care of us from the beginning on and helped us to improve our listings on the marketplace.'),(47,'content:7.headline','input','100% Guaranteed Customer Satisfaction'),(47,'content:7.lead','wysiwyg','<p>We are fully committed to offer all our customers and partners the best services available.&nbsp;<br />\nPlease read what our dealers, private sellers and buyers have to say about our demo classic car marketplace.</p>\n'),(47,'content:8.author','input','John Doe, Car Collector, Montana, USA'),(47,'content:8.position','select','left'),(47,'content:8.quote','input','Just an amazing marketplace, bought already 3 of my vintage cars. Highly recommended! '),(47,'headline','input','Find & Buy Classic Cars'),(48,'content','areablock','a:9:{i:0;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"1\";s:4:\"type\";s:9:\"headlines\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:1;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"2\";s:4:\"type\";s:19:\"wysiwyg-with-images\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:2;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"3\";s:4:\"type\";s:21:\"gallery-single-images\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:3;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"4\";s:4:\"type\";s:7:\"wysiwyg\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:4;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"5\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"blockquote\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:5;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"6\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"featurette\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:6;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"7\";s:4:\"type\";s:5:\"image\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:7;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"8\";s:4:\"type\";s:14:\"text-accordion\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:8;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"9\";s:4:\"type\";s:15:\"icon-teaser-row\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}}'),(48,'content:1.headline','input','Where some content-blocks are mixed together.'),(48,'content:1.lead','wysiwyg',''),(48,'content:2.content','wysiwyg','<p>Li Europan lingues es membres del sam familie. Lor separat existentie es un myth. Por scientie, musica, sport etc, litot Europa usa li sam vocabular. Li lingues differe solmen in li grammatica, li pronunciation e li plu commun vocabules. Omnicos directe al desirabilite de un nov lingua franca:</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>On refusa continuar payar custosi traductores. At solmen va esser necessi far uniform grammatica, pronunciation e plu sommun paroles. Ma quande lingues coalesce, li grammatica del resultant lingue es plu simplic e regulari quam ti del coalescent lingues. Li nov lingua franca va esser plu simplic e regulari quam li existent Europan lingues. It va esser tam simplic quam Occidental in fact, it va esser Occidental.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>A un Angleso it va semblar un simplificat Angles, quam un skeptic Cambridge amico dit me que Occidental es.Li Europan lingues es membres del sam familie. Lor separat existentie es un myth. Por scientie, musica, sport etc, litot Europa usa li sam vocabular. Li lingues differe solmen in li grammatica, li pronunciation e li plu commun vocabules. Omnicos directe al desirabilite de un nov lingua franca: On refusa continuar payar custosi traductores. At solmen va esser necessi far uniform grammatica, pronunciation e plu sommun paroles.</p>\n'),(48,'content:2.images','block','a:2:{i:0;s:1:\"1\";i:1;s:1:\"2\";}'),(48,'content:2.images:1.image','image','a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:62;s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"cropPercent\";N;s:9:\"cropWidth\";N;s:10:\"cropHeight\";N;s:7:\"cropTop\";N;s:8:\"cropLeft\";N;s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}}'),(48,'content:2.images:2.image','image','a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:63;s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"cropPercent\";N;s:9:\"cropWidth\";N;s:10:\"cropHeight\";N;s:7:\"cropTop\";N;s:8:\"cropLeft\";N;s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}}'),(48,'content:3.gallery','block','a:3:{i:0;s:1:\"1\";i:1;s:1:\"2\";i:2;s:1:\"3\";}'),(48,'content:3.gallery:1.image','image','a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:321;s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"cropPercent\";N;s:9:\"cropWidth\";N;s:10:\"cropHeig