 pretium. Integer tincidunt. Cras dapibus.</p>\n\n<p>Vivamus elementum semper nisi. Aenean vulputate eleifend tellus. Aenean leo ligula, porttitor eu, consequat vitae, eleifend ac, enim. Aliquam lorem ante, dapibus in, viverra quis, feugiat a, tellus. Phasellus viverra nulla ut metus varius laoreet. Quisque rutrum. Aenean imperdiet. Etiam ultricies nisi vel augue.<br />\nCurabitur ullamcorper ultricies nisi. Nam eget dui. Etiam rhoncus. Maecenas tempus, tellus eget condimentum rhoncus, sem quam semper libero, sit amet adipiscing sem neque sed ipsum. Nam quam nunc, blandit vel, luctus pulvinar, hendrerit id, lorem. Maecenas nec odio et ante tincidunt tempus. Donec vitae sapien ut libero venenatis faucibus.</p>\n'),(104,'headline','input','Pick of the Day'),(105,'content','areablock','a:0:{}'),(105,'greeting','input','Hello %DataObject(customerId,{\"method\" : \"getFirstname\"});'),(105,'greeting_text','wysiwyg','<p>Follow&nbsp;<a href=\"{{ tokenLink }}\">Link</a> to confirm your newsletter registration.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>See you there...</p>\n\n<p>The Pimcore Crew</p>\n'),(105,'title','input','Newsletter Confirmation'),(106,'image','image','a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:361;s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"cropPercent\";N;s:9:\"cropWidth\";N;s:10:\"cropHeight\";N;s:7:\"cropTop\";N;s:8:\"cropLeft\";N;s:8:\"hotspots\";N;s:6:\"marker\";N;}'),(106,'link','link','a:15:{s:12:\"internalType\";s:8:\"document\";s:8:\"linktype\";s:8:\"internal\";s:4:\"text\";s:9:\"Read more\";s:4:\"path\";s:8:\"/en/News\";s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"parameters\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"accesskey\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"rel\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"tabindex\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"attributes\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"internal\";b:1;s:10:\"internalId\";i:65;}'),(106,'text','wysiwyg','Lor separat existentie es un myth. Por scientie, musica, sport etc, litot Europa usa li sam vocabular.&nbsp;'),(106,'title','input','Hot News from the Garage'),(107,'image','image','a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:360;s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"cropPercent\";N;s:9:\"cropWidth\";N;s:10:\"cropHeight\";N;s:7:\"cropTop\";N;s:8:\"cropLeft\";N;s:8:\"hotspots\";N;s:6:\"marker\";N;}'),(107,'link','link','a:15:{s:12:\"internalType\";s:8:\"document\";s:8:\"linktype\";s:8:\"internal\";s:4:\"text\";s:8:\"See more\";s:4:\"path\";s:24:\"/en/Magazine/Car Gallery\";s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"parameters\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"anchor\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"accesskey\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"rel\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"tabindex\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"attributes\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"internal\";b:1;s:10:\"internalId\";i:103;}'),(107,'text','wysiwyg','Aenean imperdiet. Etiam ultricies nisi vel augue.<br />\n<br />\n&nbsp;Nam eget dui. Etiam rhoncus.'),(107,'title','input','Car Gallery'),(110,'content','areablock','a:9:{i:0;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"2\";s:4:\"type\";s:9:\"headlines\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:1;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"1\";s:4:\"type\";s:7:\"wysiwyg\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:2;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"3\";s:4:\"type\";s:7:\"wysiwyg\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:3;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"4\";s:4:\"type\";s:9:\"headlines\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:4;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"5\";s:4:\"type\";s:7:\"wysiwyg\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:5;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"6\";s:4:\"type\";s:9:\"headlines\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:6;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"9\";s:4:\"type\";s:19:\"wysiwyg-with-images\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:7;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"7\";s:4:\"type\";s:9:\"headlines\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:8;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"8\";s:4:\"type\";s:19:\"wysiwyg-with-images\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}}'),(110,'content:1.content','wysiwyg','<h6>Interessed-based Target Groups</h6>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Luxury-Cars-Fan\n	<ul>\n		<li>Visit at least 5 pages in luxury car area</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li>Economy-Cars-Fan\n	<ul>\n		<li>Visit at least 5 pages in economy car area</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li>Sports-Cars-Fan\n	<ul>\n		<li>Visit at least 5 pages in sports car area</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n'),(110,'content:2.headline','input','Target Groups'),(110,'content:2.lead','wysiwyg','<p>Following Target Groups with profiling rules are defined in the system.</p>\n'),(110,'content:3.content','wysiwyg','<h6>Sales based Target Groups</h6>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>New Customer\n	<ul>\n		<li>Place one order</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li>Regular Customer\n	<ul>\n		<li>Place more that one and less than 5 orders</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li>VIP Customer\n	<ul>\n		<li>Place more than 5 orders</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n'),(110,'content:4.headline','input','Segment Calculation'),(110,'content:4.lead','wysiwyg','<p>For loggin-in customers following segments will be calculated (if profiling is allowed for customer).</p>\n'),(110,'content:5.content','wysiwyg','<h6>Based on customer data</h6>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Gender: female, male, not-set</li>\n	<li>State: based on ZIP defined in customer data</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h6>Based on customer behavior</h6>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Interests: based on manufacturer, body-style and car-class of ordered products</li>\n	<li>VisitingCount: based on visits of user</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n'),(110,'content:6.headline','input','Marketing Automation'),(110,'content:6.lead','wysiwyg','<p>Following marketing automation is configured.</p>\n'),(110,'content:7.headline','input','Personalization'),(110,'content:7.lead','wysiwyg','<p>Following personalization is configured.</p>\n'),(110,'content:8.content','wysiwyg','<h6>Manual Personalization</h6>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Portal page hero slider personalized for target groups\n	<ul>\n		<li>Luxury-Cars-Fan</li>\n		<li>Economy-Cars-Fan</li>\n		<li>Sports-Cars-Fan</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h6>Automatic Personalization</h6>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Visit pages to collect segements to your visitor info\n	<ul>\n		<li>Manually tagged\n		<ul>\n			<li><a href=\"/en/Magazine/Pick%20of%20the%20Day\" pimcore_id=\"104\" pimcore_type=\"document\">Pick of the Day</a></li>\n			<li><a href=\"/en/More-Stuff/Landingpages/Chevrolet\" pimcore_id=\"54\" pimcore_type=\"document\">Chevrolet</a></li>\n			<li><a href=\"/en/More-Stuff/Landingpages/Ford-Musclecars\" pimcore_id=\"55\" pimcore_type=\"document\">Ford-Musclecars</a></li>\n			<li><a href=\"/en/More-Stuff/Landingpages/Vans\" pimcore_id=\"56\" pimcore_type=\"document\">Vans</a></li>\n			<li><a href=\"/en/More-Stuff/Landingpages/Volkswagen\" pimcore_id=\"57\" pimcore_type=\"document\">Volkswagen</a></li>\n		</ul>\n		</li>\n		<li>Automatically tagged\n		<ul>\n			<li>category pages like&nbsp;<a href=\"/en/shop/Products/Cars/Economy-Cars/City-Cars~c548?pimcore_editmode=true&amp;systemLocale=en&amp;_dc=1566895234726&amp;unminified_js=\" pimcore_id=\"548\" pimcore_type=\"object\">city cars</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"/en/shop/Products/Cars/Economy-Cars/Economy-Cars~c561?pimcore_editmode=true&amp;systemLocale=en&amp;_dc=1566895234726&amp;unminified_js=\" pimcore_id=\"561\" pimcore_type=\"object\">economy cars</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"/en/shop/Products/Cars/Economy-Cars/Family-Cars~c551?pimcore_editmode=true&amp;systemLocale=en&amp;_dc=1566895234726&amp;unminified_js=\" pimcore_id=\"551\" pimcore_type=\"object\">family cars</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"/en/shop/Products/Cars/Luxury-Cars/Executive-Cars~c550?pimcore_editmode=true&amp;systemLocale=en&amp;_dc=1566895234726&amp;unminified_js=\" pimcore_id=\"550\" pimcore_type=\"object\">executive cars</a>, etc.</li>\n			<li>all product detail pages</li>\n		</ul>\n		</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li>Portal page product teaser row automatically personalized based on tracked interests\n	<ul>\n		<li>manufacturer</li>\n		<li>car class</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n'),(110,'content:8.images','block','a:3:{i:0;s:1:\"1\";i:1;s:1:\"2\";i:2;s:1:\"4\";}'),(110,'content:8.images:1.image','image','a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:390;s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"cropPercent\";N;s:9:\"cropWidth\";N;s:10:\"cropHeight\";N;s:7:\"cropTop\";N;s:8:\"cropLeft\";N;s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}}'),(110,'content:8.images:2.image','image','a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:391;s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\