/ul>\n'),(194,'content:2.images','block','a:3:{i:0;s:1:\"1\";i:1;s:1:\"2\";i:2;s:1:\"3\";}'),(194,'content:2.images:1.image','image','a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:397;s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"cropPercent\";N;s:9:\"cropWidth\";N;s:10:\"cropHeight\";N;s:7:\"cropTop\";N;s:8:\"cropLeft\";N;s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}}'),(194,'content:2.images:2.image','image','a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:395;s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"cropPercent\";N;s:9:\"cropWidth\";N;s:10:\"cropHeight\";N;s:7:\"cropTop\";N;s:8:\"cropLeft\";N;s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}}'),(194,'content:2.images:3.image','image','a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:396;s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"cropPercent\";N;s:9:\"cropWidth\";N;s:10:\"cropHeight\";N;s:7:\"cropTop\";N;s:8:\"cropLeft\";N;s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}}'),(194,'headline','input','Workflows'),(195,'content','areablock','a:8:{i:0;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"4\";s:4:\"type\";s:9:\"headlines\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:1;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"5\";s:4:\"type\";s:19:\"wysiwyg-with-images\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:2;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"2\";s:4:\"type\";s:9:\"headlines\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:3;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"3\";s:4:\"type\";s:7:\"wysiwyg\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:4;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"1\";s:4:\"type\";s:7:\"wysiwyg\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:5;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"6\";s:4:\"type\";s:7:\"wysiwyg\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:6;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"8\";s:4:\"type\";s:7:\"wysiwyg\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:7;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"7\";s:4:\"type\";s:7:\"wysiwyg\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}}'),(195,'content:1.content','wysiwyg','<p><strong>Product - Accessory Part</strong> (add&nbsp;more fields in query: erpNumber, condition, owner)</p>\n\n<p><iframe frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"/pimcore-datahub-webservices/explorer/products?apikey=6332aa5e6d3d6c0be31da2a8b3442113&amp;query=query%20%7B%0A%20%20getAccessoryPart(id%3A%20408)%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20generatedName%0A%20%20%20%20priceInEUR%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%0A%7D%0A\" style=\"width:100%; height: 500px\"></iframe></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"/pimcore-datahub-webservices/explorer/products?apikey=6332aa5e6d3d6c0be31da2a8b3442113&amp;query=query%20%7B%0A%20%20getAccessoryPart(id%3A%20408)%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20generatedName%0A%20%20%20%20priceInEUR%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%0A%7D%0A\" target=\"_blank\">Show full screen</a></p>\n'),(195,'content:2.headline','input','Try live examples!'),(195,'content:2.lead','wysiwyg',''),(195,'content:3.content','wysiwyg','<p><strong>Product - Car</strong> (add&nbsp;more fields in query: numberOfDoors, numberOfSeats, productionYear)</p>\n\n<p><iframe frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"/pimcore-datahub-webservices/explorer/products?apikey=6332aa5e6d3d6c0be31da2a8b3442113&amp;query=query%20%7B%0A%20%20getCar(id%3A%20308)%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20name%0A%20%20%20%20description%0A%20%20%20%20color%0A%20%20%20%20priceInEUR%0A%20%20%7D%0A%7D\" style=\"width:100%; height: 500px\"></iframe></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"/pimcore-datahub-webservices/explorer/products?apikey=6332aa5e6d3d6c0be31da2a8b3442113&amp;query=query%20%7B%0A%20%20getCar(id%3A%20308)%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20name%0A%20%20%20%20description%0A%20%20%20%20color%0A%20%20%20%20priceInEUR%0A%20%20%7D%0A%7D\" target=\"_blank\">Show full screen</a></p>\n'),(195,'content:4.headline','input',''),(195,'content:4.lead','wysiwyg','<p>Data Hub plugin for Pimcore is based on GraphQL, which is a query language for APIs.&nbsp;After sending a GraphQL query to your API endpoint, you will get exactly what you need, since GraphQL returns completely predictable results.</p>\n'),(195,'content:5.content','wysiwyg','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">API endpoints are configured in Pimcore&nbsp;admin with schema defintions to provide structure for accessing and creating the data.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>products:</strong>&nbsp;product related data&nbsp;like Cars, AccessoryParts, Categories etc.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>shop:</strong>&nbsp;shop related information like Orders, OrderItems, Vouchers.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>assets:</strong>&nbsp;media related to Brands, Products etc.<br />\n<br />\nData Hub plugin supports Queries and Mutation for Data Objects &amp; Assets.</span></p>\n'),(195,'content:5.images','block','a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"1\";}'),(195,'content:5.images:1.image','image','a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:399;s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"cropPercent\";N;s:9:\"cropWidth\";N;s:10:\"cropHeight\";N;s:7:\"cropTop\";N;s:8:\"cropLeft\";N;s:8:\"hotspots\";a:0:{}s:6:\"marker\";a:0:{}}'),(195,'content:6.content','wysiwyg','<p><strong>Assets - Brand Logo Image</strong> (add&nbsp;more fields in query: mimetype, filesize)</p>\n\n<p><iframe frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"/pimcore-datahub-webservices/explorer/assets?apikey=9e265983fbd2dc42b8f7cdb841c82807&amp;query=%7B%0A%20%20getAsset(id%3A%20311)%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20filename%0A%20%20%20%20type%0A%20%20%20%20fullpath%0A%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0A\" style=\"width:100%; height: 500px\"></iframe></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"/pimcore-datahub-webservices/explorer/assets?apikey=9e265983fbd2dc42b8f7cdb841c82807&amp;query=%7B%0A%20%20getAsset(id%3A%20311)%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20filename%0A%20%20%20%20type%0A%20%20%20%20fullpath%0A%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0A\" target=\"_blank\">Show full screen</a></p>\n'),(195,'content:7.content','wysiwyg','<p>For a live example of content-as-a-service (CaaS) / headless CMS please have a look at the&nbsp;<a href=\"/en/Events\" rel=\"nofollow\">events page</a>. This page fetches the data from Pimcore backend via GraphQL with a Data Hub endpoint.</p>\n'),(195,'content:8.content','wysiwyg','<p><strong>Mutation - Create&nbsp;Car Object</strong> (run query to create car object under folder \"/upload/new\")</p>\n\n<p><iframe frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"/pimcore-datahub-webservices/explorer/products?apikey=6332aa5e6d3d6c0be31da2a8b3442113&amp;query=mutation%20%7B%0A%20%20createCar(parentId%3A%201086%2C%20key%3A%20&quot;Datahub-car-1&quot;%2C%20published%3A%20false%2C%0A%20%20input%3A%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20name%3A%20&quot;Datahub-car-1&quot;%2C%0A%20%20%7D)%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20success%0A%20%20%20%20message%0A%20%20%20%20output%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20id%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20name%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0A\" style=\"width:100%; height: 500px\"></iframe></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"/pimcore-datahub-webservices/explorer/products?apikey=9e265983fbd2dc42b8f7cdb841c82807&amp;query=%7B%0A%20%20getAsset(id%3A%20311)%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20filename%0A%20%20%20%20type%0A%20%20%20%20fullpath%0A%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0A\" target=\"_blank\">Show full screen</a></p>\n'),(195,'headline','input','Data Hub'),(198,'content','areablock','a:2:{i:0;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"1\";s:4:\"type\";s:9:\"headlines\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}i:1;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"2\";s:4:\"type\";s:14:\"product-teaser\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}}'),(198,'content:1.headline','input','Sorry, the page you\'re looking for has gone.'),(198,'content:1.lead','wysiwyg',''),(198,'content:2.productTeaserTitle','input','Maybe you\'re interested in some of our products?'),(198,'content:2.teaserblock','block','a:3:{i:0;s:1:\"1\";i:1;s:1:\"2\";i:2;s:1:\"3\";}'),(198,'content:2.teaserblock:1.productTeaser','renderlet','a:3:{s:2:\"id\";i:253;s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"object\";s:7:\"subtype\";s:6:\"object\";}'),(198,'content:2.teaserblock:2.productTeaser','renderlet','a:3:{s:2:\"id\";i:252;s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"object\";s:7:\"subtype\";s:6:\"object\";}'),(198,'content:2.teaserblock:3.productTeaser','renderlet','a:3:{s:2:\"id\";i:98;s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"object\";s:7:\"subtype\";s:6:\"object\";}'),(198,'headline','input','Oooops ...'),(199,'headline','input','TEnant Switches'),(200,'content','areablock','a:1:{i:0;a:3:{s:3:\"key\";s:1:\"1\";s:4:\"type\";s:9:\"headlines\";s:6:\"hidden\";b:0;}}'),(200,'content:1.headline','input','AUTO SHOWS\'19'),(200,'content:1.lead','wysiwyg','<p>This page is based on vuejs+apollo which calls Datahub API to fetch events data from Pimcore.</p>\n');
