bile Salon event this February. Hatlapa car’s virtues explain why Ferraris dominate rankings rarefied group only about total have equivalent £5m (see graphic page 4). “Ferrari produced hand-made very small series always had strong competition pedigree.” But you don’t need big cat prancing stallion bonnet achieve eye-watering prices. same Artcurial sale rare Citroen Sahara fetched almost €192 000 way its high estimate €90 000. WEALTH REPORT UPDATE LUXURY INVESTMENT INDEX KFLII performance versus other classes (to 2016) FTSE 100 PCL* CARS 10-year price volatility GOLD Most volatile 600 Volatility 400 300 200 100 *Knight Frank Prime Central London Residential Source Research Gold FTSE Cars Stamps Art Wine Coins PCL* Coloured Diamonds Jewellery Chinese ceramics Watches Furniture (Q1 2006=100) 500 Based points Source Research YEARS YEARS MONTHS performance class (to 2016*) ANTIQUE FURNITURE -6% ART -5% CHINESE ANTIQUE CERAMICS FURNITURE 12% -22% CHINESE CERAMICS -2% ART 16% COLOURED DIAMONDS STAMPS 21% CHINESE WATCHES COLOURED ANTIQUE CERAMICS 65% DIAMONDS FURNITURE 129% -30% COLOURED WATCHES DIAMONDS 32% 31% STAMPS JEWELLERY 133% 163% *Except data stamps coins updated annually. Coloured diamond data bi-annual until 2014. Source See back page details suppliers COINS WINE CARS WINE 32% 50% JEWELLERY 63% COINS 73% CARS COINS 195% 206% WINE STAMPS JEWELLERY WATCHES 189% ART 245% 17% 161% 467% Least volatile WEALTH REPORT UPDATE LUXURY INVESTMENT INDEX OTHERS MERCEDES-BENZ BUGATTI JAGUAR MCLAREN ALFA ROMEO Under bonnet ASTON MARTIN BENTLEY DUESENBERG FORD With help HAGI look nuts bolts classic PORSCHE Top marques Endurance race Number auction £5m (all time) Five-year change era* 300 1950/60s 300% 1970s 280% 250 OTHERS FERRARI 33% MERCEDES-BENZ BUGATTI JAGUAR MCLAREN ALFA ROMEO ASTON MARTIN BENTLEY DUESENBERG FORD PORSCHE OTHERS 150 ased representative models sub production Podium finish Buyers guide Affordable/ overlooked classics bracket Annual change marque (12 months May 